  "details": "I usually leave my camera above my head when on standby, but sometimes it (feels like, at least) contributes to lag to have it open all the time. But also grabbing for the camera when its not out and then having go through all the menuing to open it up might cause me to miss some shots. It would be nice to have an option to do some kind of gesture to quickly pull out the camera.\n\nIt would be also be neat if it could tie into avatar dynamics - e.g. “pocketing” the camera in a placed trigger can put it away, “holstering” the camera can toggle on a prop camera on the avatar, etc.",
